---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Bayu Distira">
  <div class="py-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-0">
    
    {/* 1. PROFESSIONAL IDENTITY */}
    <div class="mb-24 flex flex-col items-center md:items-start text-center md:text-left">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Bayu Distira Azis</h1>
      <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-sans text-brand-text/60 mb-6">ByU</h2>
      
      <p class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/50 uppercase mb-6">
        Informatics Student &middot; Builder &middot; Writer
      </p>
      
      <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/70 text-lg max-w-2xl mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Based in Indonesia. Interested in technology, software, science, literature, sports, people and the universe.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center md:justify-start gap-4">
        <a href="#" class="px-6 py-3 bg-brand-text text-brand-bg font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:bg-brand-accent transition-colors">
          Download CV &darr;
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/ByU-7" target="_blank" class="px-6 py-3 border border-brand-text/20 text-brand-text font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:border-brand-text transition-colors">
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="px-6 py-3 border border-brand-text/20 text-brand-text font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:border-brand-text transition-colors">
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:firqiansyahbayu@gmail.com" class="px-6 py-3 border border-brand-text/20 text-brand-text font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-bold rounded-sm hover:border-brand-text transition-colors">
          Email
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* QUOTE */}
    <div class="my-32 text-center">
      <p class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif italic text-brand-text/80 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        "I like understanding things by taking things apart..."
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 my-24"></div>

    {/* 2. A LITTLE ABOUT ME */}
    <div class="mb-32 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center md:text-left">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase mb-8">A Little About Me</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 font-serif text-brand-text/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I am an Informatics student whose curiosity often spills beyond the edges of a computer screen. While my formal education teaches me how to write efficient algorithms and structure databases, my true passion lies in understanding how things work. whether it's a piece of software, human nature, or the cosmos.
        </p>
        <p>
          I build things because I want to see if I can. I write because it is the only way I can untangle the thoughts in my head. And I explore because the world is too vast to only be seen from one perspective.
        </p>
        <p>
          I believe that the best software is built by people who read books, watch films, and take walks. Technology is just a tool; the stories we tell and the problems we solve with it are what actually matter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 my-24"></div>

    {/* 3. WHAT I DO */}
    <div class="mb-32">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase mb-16 text-center">What I Do</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 text-center">
        <a href="/work" class="group block p-8 border border-brand-text/5 hover:border-brand-text/20 transition-colors bg-brand-bg rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">BUILD</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/60 mb-6">Websites, applications, and experiments.</p>
          <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase">See Projects &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/writing" class="group block p-8 border border-brand-text/5 hover:border-brand-text/20 transition-colors bg-brand-bg rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">WRITE</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/60 mb-6">Essays and reflections about things I find worth thinking about.</p>
          <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase">Read Essays &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/wander" class="group block p-8 border border-brand-text/5 hover:border-brand-text/20 transition-colors bg-brand-bg rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text mb-4 group-hover:text-brand-accent transition-colors">EXPLORE</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/60 mb-6">Ideas, places, activities, and experiences outside my routine.</p>
          <span class="text-xs font-sans tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase">View Log &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 my-24"></div>

    {/* 4. THINGS I LIKE */}
    <div class="mb-32">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase mb-16 text-center">Things I Like</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        {/* Films */}
        <div>
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/60 text-xl">Films</h3>
            <a href="https://letterboxd.com/" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-sans tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-text/40 hover:text-[#00e054] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Letterboxd <span class="text-lg leading-none">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            {[
              { title: 'Interstellar', bg: 'bg-stone-800', text: 'text-stone-300' },
              { title: 'The Secret Life of Walter Mitty', bg: 'bg-sky-900', text: 'text-sky-200' },
              { title: 'Dead Poets Society', bg: 'bg-emerald-900', text: 'text-emerald-200' },
              { title: 'Oppenheimer', bg: 'bg-orange-950', text: 'text-orange-200' }
            ].map(film => (
              <div class={`aspect-[2/3] ${film.bg} border border-brand-text/10 flex items-center justify-center text-center p-4 rounded-sm hover:ring-2 hover:ring-[#00e054]/60 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-sm`}>
                <span class={`font-serif italic ${film.text} text-sm`}>{film.title}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Music */}
        <div class="pt-8">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-6">
            <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/60 text-xl">Music</h3>
            <a href="https://open.spotify.com/" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-sans tracking-wider uppercase text-brand-text/40 hover:text-[#1DB954] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Spotify <span class="text-lg leading-none">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            {[
              { name: 'Linkin Park', type: 'Artist' },
              { name: 'My Chemical Romance', type: 'Artist' },
              { name: 'Simple Plan', type: 'Artist' },
              { name: 'Hindia', type: 'Artist' }
            ].map(artist => (
              <div class="bg-brand-text/[0.03] p-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-text/[0.06] transition-colors cursor-pointer group">
                <div class="w-full aspect-square bg-[#e6e2d6] rounded-full mb-4 shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center group-hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
                   <div class="text-brand-text/20 font-serif text-4xl">&spadesuit;</div>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-sans font-bold text-brand-text text-sm truncate">{artist.name}</h4>
                <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/50 text-xs mt-1">{artist.type}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Books */}
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/60 text-xl mb-4">Books</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-lg">Norwegian Wood &middot; Cosmos &middot; Pale Blue Dot</p>
        </div>

        {/* Sport */}
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/60 text-xl mb-4">Sport</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-lg">Badminton &middot; Futsal</p>
        </div>

        {/* Thoughts */}
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/60 text-xl mb-4">Things I Could Spend Hours Thinking About</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            The universe <br/>
            Human nature <br/>
            Why people do what they do <br/>
            How things work
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 my-24"></div>

    {/* 5. CURRENTLY */}
    <div class="mb-32 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase mb-12 text-center">Currently</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-y-12 gap-x-16">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 mb-2">Learning</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-lg">Astro &amp; Modern Web Development</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 mb-2">Building</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-lg">This digital garden</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 mb-2">Reading</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-lg">Norwegian Wood</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 mb-2">Listening</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-lg">Linkin Park</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2">
          <h3 class="font-serif italic text-brand-text/50 mb-2">Wondering About</h3>
          <p class="font-sans text-brand-text/80 font-bold text-xl leading-relaxed">
            If we are a way for the universe to know itself, what does it think of us?
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full h-px bg-brand-text/10 my-24"></div>

    {/* 6. MILESTONES */}
    <div class="mb-32 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-text/40 uppercase mb-12 text-center">A Few Milestones</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6 font-sans text-brand-text/80">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8">
          <div class="font-bold w-16 shrink-0 mb-1 md:mb-0">2026</div>
          <div>Built this personal digital archive.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8">
          <div class="font-bold w-16 shrink-0 mb-1 md:mb-0">2025</div>
          <div>Began studying Informatics, learning how to take software apart.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:gap-8">
          <div class="font-bold w-16 shrink-0 mb-1 md:mb-0">2023</div>
          <div>Started exploring UI/UX design.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* OUTRO */}
    <div class="mt-40 mb-20 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-brand-text/40 leading-relaxed italic">
        I don't have everything figured out.<br/>
        Still wondering.<br/>
        Still wandering.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
